Mark Viera's new special, "Mark My Words," is a must-see. Houston, get ready for a night of laughs. Born in the Bronx, Mark's comedy is all about real-life stories and spot-on impressions. Whether he's talking about family or life in the Bronx, his lighthearted style makes you feel right at home. Don’t miss him live at Punch Line Houston this Thursday, April 9, 2026. Link in bio for tickets. Tag someone you'd bring. 

