Peter Revello made his late-night debut on 'The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon' last November. Houston, here's your chance to catch him live. With his sharp wit and relatable humor, Peter taps into the everyday with stories from his Staten Island roots. Think marriage, life, and a blue-collar lens. It's real, it's funny, and it's happening in your city. The Riot Comedy Club upstairs at Rudyard's · Friday, April 10, 2026. Link in bio for tickets. Tag someone you'd bring.

